# Backend Structure Convention

Workers and services live under:

```
backend_v3/services/{platform}/{feature}/{type}/{worker-name}/
```

## Platforms

- `facebook`, `youtube`, `instagram`

## Features (examples)

- `auto-download-upload` — scrape → download → publish to Facebook
- `inapp-schedule` — queue posts published by our cron

## Types

- `posting` — job processors, publishers, schedulers
- `analytics` — metrics crons
- `scraping` — VPS scrapers

## Example

```
backend_v3/services/facebook/auto-download-upload/posting/scheduler-worker/
backend_v3/services/facebook/auto-download-upload/scraping/reels-scraper/
backend_v3/services/facebook/inapp-schedule/posting/processor-worker/
```

Do not add flat `services/posting/` or `services/scraper/` paths for new work. Update deploy scripts when moving workers.
